{"id":3409,"slug":"3409-v-once-va-v-pre-dung-khi-nao-de-skip-rendering","category":"Vue.js","subcategory":"Performance","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"`v-once` và `v-pre` — dùng khi nào để skip rendering?","question_en":"`v-once` and `v-pre` — when to use them to skip rendering?","answer_vi":"`v-once`: render element/component **một lần duy nhất** — skip future updates. Sau khi render, element được xử lý như static content:\n\n```vue\n<!-- Static content không bao giờ thay đổi -->\n<h1 v-once>{{ appName }}</h1>\n\n<!-- Expensive initial render, không bao giờ update -->\n<StaticBanner v-once :data=\"bannerConfig\" />\n\n<!-- Kết hợp với v-for — freeze sau render đầu -->\n<div v-for=\"item in list\" :key=\"item.id\" v-once>\n  {{ item.name }}\n</div>\n```\n\n`v-pre`: **skip compilation** toàn bộ subtree — dùng cho content muốn hiển thị mustache syntax như raw text:\n\n```vue\n<!-- Hiển thị '{{ this is NOT compiled }}' -->\n<span v-pre>{{ this is NOT compiled }}</span>\n\n<!-- Dùng trong docs/code display components -->\n<code v-pre>const x = ref(0)</code>\n```\n\n**Khác nhau**: `v-once` render rồi freeze (tốt cho performance). `v-pre` skip compile entirely (tốt cho mustache syntax display).\n\nLưu ý: `v-once` trong component vẫn chạy `setup()` và reactive setup — chỉ DOM update bị skip.","answer_en":"`v-once`: render **once only** — skip future updates:\n```vue\n<h1 v-once>{{ appName }}</h1>  <!-- Never re-renders -->\n<StaticBanner v-once :data=\"config\" />\n```\n\n`v-pre`: **skip compilation** — display mustache syntax as raw text:\n```vue\n<!-- Shows '{{ this is NOT compiled }}' literally -->\n<span v-pre>{{ this is NOT compiled }}</span>\n```\n\n**Difference**: `v-once` renders then freezes (performance). `v-pre` skips compilation entirely (for displaying template syntax).\n\nPitfall: `v-once` still runs `setup()` — only DOM updates are skipped.","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><code>v-once</code>: render element/component <strong>một lần duy nhất</strong> — skip future updates.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Sau khi render, element được xử lý như static content:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- Static content không bao giờ thay đổi --&gt;\n&lt;h1 v-once&gt;{{ appName }}&lt;/h1&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- Expensive initial render, không bao giờ update --&gt;\n&lt;StaticBanner v-once :data=&quot;bannerConfig&quot; /&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- Kết hợp với v-for — freeze sau render đầu --&gt;\n&lt;div v-for=&quot;item in list&quot; :key=&quot;item.id&quot; v-once&gt;\n  {{ item.name }}\n&lt;/div&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Static content không bao giờ thay đổi --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-once</span>&gt;</span>{{ appName }}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Expensive initial render, không bao giờ update --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">StaticBanner</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-once</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:data</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;bannerConfig&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Kết hợp với v-for — freeze sau render đầu --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;item in list&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:key</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;item.id&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-once</span>&gt;</span>\n  {{ item.name }}\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p><code>v-pre</code>: <strong>skip compilation</strong> toàn bộ subtree — dùng cho content muốn hiển thị mustache syntax như raw text:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- Hiển thị '{{ this is NOT compiled }}' --&gt;\n&lt;span v-pre&gt;{{ this is NOT compiled }}&lt;/span&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- Dùng trong docs/code display components --&gt;\n&lt;code v-pre&gt;const x = ref(0)&lt;/code&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Hiển thị &#x27;{{ this is NOT compiled }}&#x27; --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-pre</span>&gt;</span>{{ this is NOT compiled }}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Dùng trong docs/code display components --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">code</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-pre</span>&gt;</span>const x = ref(0)<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">code</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Khác nhau</strong>: <code>v-once</code> render rồi freeze (tốt cho performance). <code>v-pre</code> skip compile entirely (tốt cho mustache syntax display).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Lưu ý: <code>v-once</code> trong component vẫn chạy <code>setup()</code> và reactive setup — chỉ DOM update bị skip.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>v-once</code>: render <strong>once only</strong> — skip future updates:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;h1 v-once&gt;{{ appName }}&lt;/h1&gt;  &lt;!-- Never re-renders --&gt;\n&lt;StaticBanner v-once :data=&quot;config&quot; /&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-once</span>&gt;</span>{{ appName }}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Never re-renders --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">StaticBanner</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-once</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:data</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;config&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p><code>v-pre</code>: <strong>skip compilation</strong> — display mustache syntax as raw text:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- Shows '{{ this is NOT compiled }}' literally --&gt;\n&lt;span v-pre&gt;{{ this is NOT compiled }}&lt;/span&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Shows &#x27;{{ this is NOT compiled }}&#x27; literally --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-pre</span>&gt;</span>{{ this is NOT compiled }}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Difference</strong>: <code>v-once</code> renders then freezes (performance). <code>v-pre</code> skips compilation entirely (for displaying template syntax).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Pitfall: <code>v-once</code> still runs <code>setup()</code> — only DOM updates are skipped.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3200-vue-js-la-gi-khac-react-angular-the-nao","title":"Vue.js là gì? Khác React/Angular thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3201-options-api-vs-composition-api-khac-nhau-gi","title":"Options API vs Composition API — khác nhau gì?"},{"url":"/q/3202-script-setup-la-gi-loi-ich-so-voi-setup-thong-thuong","title":"`<script setup>` là gì? Lợi ích so với `setup()` thông thường?"},{"url":"/q/3204-single-file-component-sfc-la-gi","title":"Single File Component (SFC) là gì?"},{"url":"/q/3205-cac-directive-pho-bien-trong-vue-v-if-v-show-v-for-v-model-v-bind-v-on","title":"Các directive phổ biến trong Vue: v-if, v-show, v-for, v-model, v-bind, v-on?"},{"url":"/q/3206-v-if-vs-v-show-khi-nao-dung-cai-nao","title":"v-if vs v-show — khi nào dùng cái nào?"},{"url":"/q/3207-tai-sao-key-trong-v-for-quan-trong","title":"Tại sao `:key` trong `v-for` quan trọng?"},{"url":"/q/3208-v-model-hoat-dong-the-nao-custom-v-model","title":"v-model hoạt động thế nào? Custom v-model?"}]}